{"id":"n5-068","title":"いつでも～","romaji":"itsudemo～","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Expresses 'anytime', 'always', or 'whenever'.","longExplanation":"The いつでも grammar point is used to express that something occurs, can occur, or is allowed to occur anytime, always, or whenever. It emphasizes the lack of restrictions related to time for a certain action or event.","formation":"いつでも + (Verb)","examples":[{"jp":"いつでも遊びに来てください。","romaji":"Itsudemo asobi ni kite kudasai.","en":"Please come to play anytime.","words":[{"surface":"いつ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"でも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"遊び","vocabId":"1542070","reading":"あそび"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"来てください","vocabId":"1547720","reading":"きてください","baseForm":"来る"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[0,1]},{"jp":"彼女はいつでも笑顔です。","romaji":"Kanojo wa itsudemo egao desu.","en":"She is always smiling.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いつ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"でも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"笑顔","vocabId":"1351400","reading":"えがお"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,3]},{"jp":"いつでも電話で連絡できます。","romaji":"Itsudemo denwa de renraku dekimasu.","en":"You can contact me by phone anytime.","words":[{"surface":"いつ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"でも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"電話","vocabId":"1443840","reading":"でんわ"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"連絡","vocabId":"1559900","reading":"れんらく"},{"surface":"でき","vocabId":"1340430","reading":"でき","baseForm":"できる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[0,1]},{"jp":"この店はいつでも混んでいます。","romaji":"Kono mise wa itsudemo konde imasu.","en":"This store is always crowded.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"店","vocabId":"1582120","reading":"みせ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いつ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"でも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"混んでいます","vocabId":"2849867","reading":"こんでいます","baseForm":"混む"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]}],"formalityLevel":"neutral","usageNote":"\"Anytime/always\" - emphasizes availability at any moment.","family":{"id":"always","name":"Always (Anytime)","relatedPoints":["n5-069"],"axis":"constraint"}}